INFO 2026-04-21 15:04:02,425 accounts.api_io [request_id=C5AA007B-8FBF-4F71-9660-3B0F4A684349] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=7 bytes=6909 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjFUMTU6MDM6MjEuMjQwOTUzKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMzMxIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "ec163f63-03d5-4976-8c27-7d15b76bcba8", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "client_message_id": "507e2ad8-a96a-439d-8591-79cfb3c49d0d", "server_message_id": "b726e18c-002a-4ed7-9dde-2dd7e8d4dae4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-21T15:02:13.088000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-21T15:02:12.996336+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ec163f63-03d5-4976-8c27-7d15b76bcba8", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好😊 我是你的健康助手 Spark，可以帮你：\n1.  查询运动、睡眠、饮食等健康数据\n2.  管理用药、体检和病历记录\n3.  规划路线、查询天气\n4.  搜索健康知识，生成营养分析\n5.  创建健康文档和任务提醒\n\n有什么需要帮忙的？", "client_message_id": "0c904849-6d33-492a-b368-6be5187fabd7", "server_message_id": "b5df97e6-c194-42b4-b977-f4d775799798", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-21T15:02:18.119000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-21T15:02:18.017732+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ec163f63-03d5-4976-8c27-7d15b76bcba8", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "生成用药处方卡片", "client_message_id": "81ff8855-ab6c-4c79-9e47-2afdc0e15166", "server_message_id": "ddfccd95-9a5b-473e-9119-c9352bd5d43e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-21T15:03:01.940000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-21T15:03:01.837128+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "1FAF7B54-E2F6-4443-B432-41941D0938B3", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260421/2D31E829-A8F3-49D0-95DB-D5C1D12F7F73/IMG_1812.jpeg", "text": "窗口：6号\n年龄：27岁\n2026/04/20 10:11\n药品数量/用法\n1盒\nMY25-02-04\n1盒\nMY25-01-04\n苏州大学附属第四医院\n门诊用药单\n门诊号：0000349056\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称/规格\n（MY25-02-04）普拉洛芬滴眼\nOpto\n液（普南扑灵）\n5ml:5mg\n用法：滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n友情提示：无\n（MY25-01-04） 盐酸氮卓斯汀\n滴眼液（爱赛平）\n6ml:3mg （0.05%）\n用法：滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n友情提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。", "type": "image", "fileId": 281, "fileMd5": "de257a30b3e928fa067b0df812b1f8cb", "fullCacheKey": "2d31e829-a8f3-49d0-95db-d5c1d12f7f73/IMG_1812.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ec163f63-03d5-4976-8c27-7d15b76bcba8", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "已为你生成处方卡片，后台会自动结构化保存。以下是提炼后的用药信息解读：\n\n**基本信息**  \n• 姓名：赵道凯 • 性别：男 • 年龄：27岁  \n• 医院：苏州大学附属第四医院 • 科室：皮肤科门诊  \n• 日期：2026-04-20 • 诊断：结膜炎\n\n**用药处方**  \n1. **普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）** 5ml:5mg × 1盒  \n   用法：滴眼，每日4次，每次1滴  \n   \n2. **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）** 6ml:3mg × 1盒  \n   用法：滴眼，每日2次，每次1滴  \n   ⚠️ 注意：开启后使用不可超过4周。\n\n卡片生成后会保存到你的健康记录中，随时可以查看。", "client_message_id": "cf50db35-464c-4e2e-b64a-fea216cee55a", "server_message_id": "03e91916-7c9a-4841-9731-9ad652a1a505", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-21T15:03:16.010000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-21T15:03:21.240953+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "561829C7-3355-498E-A328-FFD6777634E8", "text": "generate_structured_health_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "F49EFF3B-197B-485D-8580-84F8E16F06D7", "text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "870040F5-5CC2-4DF7-88FC-9BBA8B3A87A7", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "15AFC010-5DD5-4B90-8C38-59575F8102BA", "text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "41AD0389-79F0-4EC5-99DA-1BA585C08921", "text": "{\"prescriptions\":[{\"subtitle\":\"结膜炎\",\"draftJSON\":\"{\\\"diagnosis\\\":\\\"结膜炎\\\",\\\"institutionName\\\":\\\"苏州大学附属第四医院\\\",\\\"medications\\\":[{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"普南扑灵\\\",\\\"dosageForm\\\":\\\"滴眼液\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"drugName\\\":\\\"普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日四次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"普拉洛芬\\\",\\\"instructions\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"5ml:5mg\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"4\\\"},{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"爱赛平\\\",\\\"dosageForm\\\":\\\"滴眼液\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"drugName\\\":\\\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\\\",\\\"frequencyCode\\\":\\\"bid\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日两次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"盐酸氮卓斯汀\\\",\\\"instructions\\\":\\\"开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"6ml:3mg (0.05%)\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"2\\\"}],\\\"prescribedAt\\\":\\\"2026-04-20\\\"}\",\"memberID\":21,\"title\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"ossFileId\":281,\"isSaved\":true,\"id\":\"08DE837B-4F71-4166-8EEC-3813C17CA314\"}],\"medicalCases\":[],\"examReports\":[],\"medications\":[]}", "type": "structured_health_cards"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
