INFO 2026-04-21 15:05:52,945 accounts.api_io [request_id=E1152929-F6E7-4F88-87F4-5053C730CD99] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=7 bytes=42406 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMThUMDU6NDc6NDIuMzkwODM0KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMTkxIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这是什么", "client_message_id": "1b2136eb-dcff-44c7-b75f-8e6c89287ff0", "server_message_id": "242b5ec3-0199-4bd2-8c61-dc352de1c0a6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:36:49.927000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:05.573068+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "DA5A7BC0-67C0-4194-8C79-60F30D5E03A3", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/FA540D52-1C56-4567-A948-268E93B0EAB5/IMG_1780.png", "text": "保存图片", "type": "image", "fileId": 246, "fileMd5": "eaee590ba9aed4912cd3a85d1599b74a", "fullCacheKey": "fa540d52-1c56-4567-a948-268e93b0eab5/IMG_1780.png"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是一只可爱的**卡通风格小鲸鱼** 🐳\n\n它的特点是：\n- 圆润饱满的身体，呈现淡蓝色/青色调\n- 一只简单的黑色小圆眼睛\n- 微笑的弧线嘴巴\n- 小巧的尾巴和背鳍\n\n这看起来像是一个**硅胶小夜灯**或**解压玩具**的造型设计，风格非常简约治愈，常用于儿童房装饰或作为可爱的桌面摆件。\n\n你是在哪里看到这个的？是想了解它的用途，还是想知道哪里可以买到类似的产品呢？", "client_message_id": "1de40e7e-cf84-4995-9346-62fc94b6131e", "server_message_id": "744c0a17-bb7c-4c04-ac79-bab33e721ac3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:05.458000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:05.584075+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈", "client_message_id": "a9018412-39d2-4b2f-a31a-e2a7c54fab0f", "server_message_id": "2ceb36aa-2192-4be6-bc45-3d8139520df0", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:44.718000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:58.871918+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "19B971BD-CF26-439B-A342-ED914DEEFE18", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/A747D019-5E0D-4F6A-B3D3-5ECA94B4A291/IMG_1669-D4277935-9541-4D81-BDA1-FB526A45DF6F.jpeg", "text": "凉*顶=为山东省临床检验互认项目，阳谷县人民医院检验报告单\n质评合格，山东HR\n检测项目：甲状腺功能三项\n条码号：226032352250\n名：胡月芳\n病人号：3105737\n标本类型：静脉血清\n标本号：63\n性别：女\n床号：\n病人类型：门诊\n申请医生：张继惠\n龄：50岁\n科室：内分泌肾内科\n诊\n断：水肿\n序\n代码\n项目名称\n结果\n参考区间\n单位\nF13\n* 游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸\n4.97\n3.1-6.8\npmol/l\n2\nFT4\n* 游离甲状腺素\n15.23\n12-22\nPmol/L\n3\nTSH\n* 促甲状腺激素\n5.19\n0.27-4.2\nWIU/ml\n备注：标*项目为山东省临床检验互认项目，“女”标识等同于“京津冀鲁HR” 标识\n-\n申请时间：2026-03-23\n08:20\n接收时间：2026-03-23 09:16\n检验者：\n采样时间：2026-03-23\n08:58\n报告时间：2026-03-23\n10:38\n注：本报告仅对所检测标本负责，供临床医生参考！\n第1页共1页\nHht，阳谷且苗河路与黄小路交叉路口\n由任.1625-5106177", "type": "image", "fileId": 247, "fileMd5": "44f8d8069415467a3e082fe9677ba831", "fullCacheKey": "a747d019-5e0d-4f6a-b3d3-5eca94b4a291/IMG_1669-D4277935-9541-4D81-BDA1-FB526A45DF6F.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我看到这是一份**甲状腺功能三项**的检验报告单。让我为您解读一下：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 报告基本信息\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| 医院 | 阳谷县人民医院 |\n| 姓名 | 胡月芳 |\n| 性别/年龄 | 女 / 50岁 |\n| 科室 | 内分泌肾内科 |\n| 诊断 | 水肿 |\n| 采样时间 | 2026-03-23 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔬 检验结果解读\n\n| 项目 | 结果 | 参考区间 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **FT3** (游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸) | 4.97 | 3.1-6.8 pmol/L | ✅ **正常** |\n| **FT4** (游离甲状腺素) | 15.23 | 12-22 pmol/L | ✅ **正常** |\n| **TSH** (促甲状腺激素) | **5.19** | 0.27-4.2 μIU/ml | ⚠️ **偏高** |\n\n---\n\n## 💡 关键提示\n\n**TSH轻度升高**（5.19，参考上限4.2），而FT3、FT4正常，这种情况称为 **\"亚临床甲状腺功能减退\"（亚临床甲减）**。\n\n### 可能的原因：\n- 早期甲状腺功能减退\n- 桥本甲状腺炎（自身免疫性甲状腺炎）\n- 碘摄入异常\n- 药物影响等\n\n### 建议：\n1. **结合症状**：目前有水肿表现，可能与甲状腺功能有关\n2. **进一步检查**：建议查 **甲状腺抗体**（TPOAb、TGAb）和 **甲状腺超声**\n3. **内分泌科就诊**：由医生评估是否需要治疗\n4. **定期复查**：监测TSH变化趋势\n\n---\n\n> ⚠️ **重要提醒**：我是AI助手，以上解读仅供参考。**请务必携带报告单就诊内分泌科医生**，由医生结合完整病史和体格检查给出专业诊断和治疗建议。\n\n您还有其他关于这份报告的问题吗？", "client_message_id": "d2d6388d-e925-4e92-a696-f99ea6558c5b", "server_message_id": "f31fddad-dc68-4c0c-95cf-f0084deefedd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:58.791000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:58.879520+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "", "client_message_id": "3dcaad09-93d6-4701-bd41-9e0532430d47", "server_message_id": "64d081ce-db8d-49c7-a961-c57405cc80a9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:45:21.130000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:45:34.229355+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "74E88C2A-DEF8-4B2F-813D-DF77B28511A4", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/BFC24781-78D2-4CEB-8483-51FE030B5776/IMG_0003.jpeg", "type": "image", "fileId": 248, "fileMd5": "402c4ae12709c434aa3e81f05b775efa", "fullCacheKey": "bfc24781-78d2-4ceb-8483-51fe030b5776/IMG_0003.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是一张**风景照片**，展示的是一片**金黄色的油菜花田** 🌼\n\n画面特点：\n- 大片的**黄色油菜花**盛开，形成明亮的花海\n- 远处可以看到**绿色的山丘/丘陵**轮廓\n- 天空呈现**淡蓝色**，带有一些云层\n- 整体氛围**清新自然**，充满春天的气息\n\n这应该是春季户外拍摄的田园风光，油菜花是春季常见的观赏花卉，很多地方会举办油菜花节。照片给人一种宁静、舒适的感觉。\n\n您是想分享这张美景，还是有其他问题呢？ 😊", "client_message_id": "344c8abe-44e0-4659-9b60-671e2e129b57", "server_message_id": "c5a27b2c-59b3-4c03-93a3-60c1fe665a3b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:45:34.133000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:45:34.240818+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这是什么花", "client_message_id": "5d744a02-f98f-479b-a420-eec2e6fb38d5", "server_message_id": "6ea4d688-f878-4b84-98c9-d1900b4af8d8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:58:22.769000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:58:43.180844+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "9DF8D2C7-4C27-4944-8CF2-7E8163B90DDD", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/4B65E442-BB34-45FC-96C0-4352FD935067/IMG_0111.jpeg", "type": "image", "fileId": 249, "fileMd5": "7363f1c787e9e1d8e82db3ebf1376e83", "fullCacheKey": "4b65e442-bb34-45fc-96c0-4352fd935067/IMG_0111.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是一朵**粉色杜鹃花**（也叫映山红）🌸\n\n它的特征：\n- **花瓣**：5片，呈柔和的粉红色，边缘略带波浪\n- **花蕊**：细长的雄蕊从花心伸出，顶端有深色花药\n- **花型**：典型的杜鹃花钟形/漏斗形\n- **叶片**：深绿色，椭圆形，边缘光滑\n\n杜鹃花是中国十大名花之一，春季盛开，花色丰富（红、粉、白、紫等），常见于山地、园林和庭院中。\n\n这朵粉色杜鹃开得正好，非常娇艳！你是在哪里拍到的呢？ 😊", "client_message_id": "c557b5e6-ce97-4e9f-9e20-47526441f491", "server_message_id": "84416451-098f-438f-a3da-9b36b868a6af", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:58:43.124000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:58:43.190046+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这是什么叶子", "client_message_id": "24b112cc-5365-4655-aa9a-974211d01ec5", "server_message_id": "6bce8999-88d2-4adb-b1b4-17db21cd0c5d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:00:45.789000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:01:04.357308+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "0DA59152-D301-473A-A2BC-936ED976AD3A", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/85C1E680-4D69-44C9-A472-3C305DAD7EA4/IMG_0002.jpeg", "type": "image", "fileId": 250, "fileMd5": "9242dddfbc1409067fb1c0447738f693", "fullCacheKey": "85c1e680-4d69-44c9-a472-3c305dad7ea4/IMG_0002.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是一片**银杏叶** 🍂\n\n它的典型特征：\n- **扇形叶片** — 呈独特的扇形或鸭脚状\n- **二叉状叶脉** — 叶脉从基部呈分叉状向边缘延伸\n- **波浪状边缘** — 叶片边缘有浅裂或波浪起伏\n- **颜色**：这张照片中的叶子呈现**金黄色**，是秋季银杏叶变色后的典型颜色\n\n银杏是中国特有的珍稀树种，被称为\"活化石\"，秋季满树金黄非常壮观，是北京、西安、成都等许多城市的行道树和观赏树种。\n\n你是在秋天拍的这片银杏叶吗？ 😊", "client_message_id": "ad3a66cc-62c7-44c6-a03f-2918821ad2f7", "server_message_id": "033c785d-7be0-48e0-90f0-eefd3eb99b26", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:01:04.303000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:01:04.369314+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "123123123", "client_message_id": "3c7309a8-8e8e-481e-8dba-412ef9c32658", "server_message_id": "153b9a56-23d7-4c6e-b190-309744fe4fab", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:02:17.371000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:02:27.001570+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"123123123\" 看起来是一串数字。请问您是想：\n\n1. **查询某个编号**？（如检验单号、订单号等）\n2. **输入验证码**？\n3. **有其他具体需求**？\n\n请告诉我更多背景信息，我可以更好地帮助您 😊", "client_message_id": "4553ac38-064a-46f0-b6ab-3c29ead8e1b1", "server_message_id": "3fd8c341-0c74-4c98-a427-a026c642c197", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:02:26.484000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:02:27.006963+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "发发发", "client_message_id": "7cc5a67b-acff-4418-b8ea-cacb0ea2f765", "server_message_id": "eb204b59-d785-4b6d-9cad-82d6cb8679bf", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:03:39.511000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:03:43.544645+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈，\"发发发\"是吉祥话呀！💰🎉\n\n是想要：\n- **发财** 💸\n- **发达** 🚀\n- **发福利** 🎁\n- 还是单纯**发个表情/发个消息**试试？\n\n有什么我可以帮你的吗？ 😄", "client_message_id": "8c4ce250-6019-424c-90f5-9b6e3628f48a", "server_message_id": "e46b4341-ceef-4ca8-b8bd-ce7481f61ddd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:03:43.521000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:03:43.554006+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "11", "client_message_id": "2fe4ea9a-c6b5-4ad9-84cc-d493652c5dfe", "server_message_id": "cb5c26e9-aef5-4034-9bd6-f26512d91d67", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:07.983000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:12.022879+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"11\" 可能代表：\n\n- **双十一**（购物节）🛒\n- **11点**（时间）\n- **11号**（日期）\n- **两个1**（数字）\n- 或者其他含义？\n\n请告诉我您的具体需求，我很乐意帮助您 😊", "client_message_id": "9d73581d-25a3-4361-ba5b-05f181c54f3c", "server_message_id": "fec53538-948e-46c3-a70a-b6958aaab16b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:11.969000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:12.035285+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "see", "client_message_id": "1ace6d61-290a-4341-a40d-4dfef0494f46", "server_message_id": "1b5df0c8-1ed9-4c60-9bfc-b1662c76bb5b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:31.785000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:35.830296+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "Hello! 👋 \n\n\"See\" 在英语中意思是**\"看/看见\"**。\n\n您是想：\n- **See you**（再见）👋\n- **让我看看什么**？（请上传图片或描述）\n- **用英语交流**？\n- 还是有其他意思？\n\n请告诉我，我很乐意帮助您！😊", "client_message_id": "cdc52727-72d8-428d-bc26-658eeddf44a5", "server_message_id": "022bcc67-ccb7-4e27-89b5-f0c839cb870b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:35.688000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:35.837838+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "更不会v", "client_message_id": "3910a0b9-2857-4e39-aff8-1ba49bf25ae0", "server_message_id": "e9a33051-ca44-4c65-bdb4-ea5efd10efca", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:24.042000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:24.228538+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"更不会v\" 看起来像是打字时的误触或输入错误。\n\n您是想表达：\n- **\"更不会\"**（表示更加不会做某事）\n- **\"更不会用\"**？\n- 还是有其他问题？\n\n请重新描述一下您的需求，我会尽力帮助您 😊", "client_message_id": "1e2ec09c-f3fe-4231-823c-26c8accf0646", "server_message_id": "9d8d1c79-aded-4998-b736-74e6dc4a747e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:28+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:27.984577+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么什么", "client_message_id": "3e3b6d13-626c-43c5-9d65-44c6240ba843", "server_message_id": "68082f76-4074-464e-8a23-e06056fbf745", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:34.948000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:34.992370+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"什么什么\" 是表示疑问或没听清的意思 😄\n\n请问您：\n- **想了解什么信息？**\n- **有什么问题需要我帮忙？**\n- **还是刚才的对话有没理解的地方？**\n\n请直接告诉我您的需求，我会尽力为您解答！🙋‍♂️", "client_message_id": "d2e26e78-8cac-44cc-bee8-11ec57699cac", "server_message_id": "4641b646-c30e-4517-ad54-2c83d9de13cf", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:38.705000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:38.687530+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "刚刚回国", "client_message_id": "d8bf7c3e-62ea-47aa-942e-9fd3b2c77c72", "server_message_id": "91dd7fb7-d743-4290-86b5-14bd4ca99b14", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:42.570000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:42.767000+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "欢迎回国！🎉 刚回国可能会遇到一些事情需要处理，以下是一些常见的事项，看看有没有您需要的：\n\n---\n\n## 🛬 回国后常见待办事项\n\n| 类别 | 具体内容 |\n|------|---------|\n| **健康相关** | 体检、疫苗补种、慢性病用药衔接、心理健康调适 |\n| **证件事务** | 身份证更新、驾照换领、银行卡重新激活 |\n| **医疗衔接** | 海外病历翻译、检查报告整理、找对应专科医生 |\n| **生活适应** | 时差调整、饮食适应、保险重新配置 |\n\n---\n\n## 💡 如果您有健康方面的需求\n\n我可以帮您：\n- 📋 整理和解读海外医疗报告\n- 🔍 查找国内对应专科医生/医院\n- 💊 药物衔接咨询（国外药品国内替代）\n- 📅 制定健康检查计划\n\n---\n\n**您回国后最想先处理什么事情呢？** 或者有具体的健康问题需要咨询？ 😊", "client_message_id": "77082faf-0410-4749-9eb8-f3d49b7c4d58", "server_message_id": "15ccce9c-ad13-444c-b9c5-1b63f8cc1709", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:50.984000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:51.065634+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "北包包v", "client_message_id": "eeaf68a9-8f15-4e5b-90c3-d584f8b982a7", "server_message_id": "65ff36ae-0a95-40d0-b2d0-5f3cbb0346df", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:58.129000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:26:58.239647+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"北包包v\" 看起来像是打字时的误触或随机输入。\n\n您是想输入：\n- **\"背包\"**（bag/backpack）🎒\n- **\"北边\"**？\n- **某个品牌名**？\n- 还是有其他意思？\n\n请重新描述一下，我很乐意帮助您！😊", "client_message_id": "44862737-2956-450e-8a28-d1e4e5337c7d", "server_message_id": "2a6075fd-dc22-4fa9-90f5-c1171b157f9b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:27:01.483000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:27:01.540211+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "图片里是什么", "client_message_id": "42768895-8d70-4582-8655-cf6390001dae", "server_message_id": "bcbc8421-5679-48df-a102-0929946b8acd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:28:19.438000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:28:19.534568+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "9E2C55BD-95C4-4B4F-973B-280BD6FD3034", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/9356EA49-613C-4E5E-8B08-72A0F3B2720A/%E5%8F%AF%E7%88%B1%E9%B2%B8%E9%B1%BC%E5%93%81%E7%89%8Clogo%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1.jpeg", "type": "image", "fileId": 251, "fileMd5": "079ae3a4208524f21d48baf67f251000", "fullCacheKey": "9356ea49-613c-4e5e-8b08-72a0f3b2720a/可爱鲸鱼品牌logo设计.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "图片里是一只**可爱的卡通小鲸鱼** 🐳\n\n它的特点：\n- **圆润的蓝色身体**，渐变色调，看起来光滑有光泽\n- **眯着眼睛**，表情很安详、满足，像是在微笑\n- **头顶喷水**，喷出几滴水珠，这是鲸鱼的标志性动作\n- **白色肚皮**，带有条纹纹理\n- 整体风格**Q萌治愈**，像是一个表情包或插画形象\n\n这只小鲸鱼给人一种**宁静、放松**的感觉，很适合用来表达\"惬意\"、\"悠闲\"或\"晚安\"的心情 😊", "client_message_id": "e1c5a225-89b8-4c11-8892-21722dc64fcf", "server_message_id": "fe5bd23e-ecc8-4e65-915c-745d67b54870", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:28:57.177000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:28:57.206861+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "为什么这么慢", "client_message_id": "88b4b4de-c807-4abe-b782-5d8ac1e81b1c", "server_message_id": "6d2faf90-f5fc-482c-953d-a108c315b3ae", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:29:05.716000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:29:05.818646+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "抱歉让您久等了！😅\n\n刚才回复慢的可能原因：\n- 我在**仔细查看图片内容**，确保描述准确\n- 网络或系统响应有轻微延迟\n\n---\n\n## 如果您觉得整体响应慢，可能的原因：\n\n| 情况 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **图片处理** | 分析图片需要一点时间 |\n| **复杂问题** | 需要查询资料时会稍慢 |\n| **网络状况** | 您或服务器端的连接速度 |\n\n---\n\n## 💡 加快响应的小建议：\n\n- 文字问题我通常回复很快 ⚡\n- 简单问题可以直接说，不用客气\n- 急需时可以告诉我\"急\"，我会优先处理\n\n**您现在有什么需要我快速回复的吗？** 我随时待命！ 🚀", "client_message_id": "5bf0d7c8-f117-4b1c-bd6b-e8f0d1d65dc9", "server_message_id": "8c2f9836-a283-4d0d-a9bc-3f8fb5d53f3e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:29:13.809000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:29:13.979039+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "1", "client_message_id": "e03ed5f5-0053-4e68-a40c-c1cad56f22f7", "server_message_id": "9ec720bd-3929-4156-a102-85f359b5a02c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:29:22.777000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:29:22.812602+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "收到！1 👍\n\n有什么需要我帮忙的吗？", "client_message_id": "1f315ffc-a716-4ccf-a2c5-2da79de06acc", "server_message_id": "f5e6c297-4034-4aa7-88d4-ee0386b18ba8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:29:24.974000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:29:24.974072+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "1", "client_message_id": "5c15c576-c8dc-4502-bb42-32b0da436df5", "server_message_id": "12720110-2ae0-4ae6-912a-3e63bf7c731e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:15.541000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:15.566302+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "收到！👍\n\n请问有什么可以帮您的？", "client_message_id": "cbceb8d6-7623-4ae1-9789-8e63c166ea44", "server_message_id": "55d21890-0a5a-4258-9cf8-87d4ec952c59", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:17.499000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:17.475041+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "不好喝", "client_message_id": "7ee872f1-5148-47b6-a3d0-f7e64676e828", "server_message_id": "eda25e81-51ba-4ee5-b1fa-d75229911c08", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:21.536000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:21.599438+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "抱歉听到您说\"不好喝\" 😅\n\n能告诉我是**什么不好喝**吗？\n\n- ☕ **咖啡**太苦/太酸？\n- 🍵 **茶**太浓/太淡？\n- 💊 **药水/中药**难以下咽？\n- 🥤 **饮料**味道不对？\n- 🥛 **牛奶/豆浆**变质了？\n\n告诉我具体情况，我可以帮您想想办法，比如怎么改善口感，或者推荐替代品 😊", "client_message_id": "1cdd259a-6d90-4513-9a4e-43f0b77ae900", "server_message_id": "5b77f2f1-ccdf-4aa6-a447-c018ecfc954c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:25.924000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:26.072129+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "1", "client_message_id": "dc05d8ef-1562-4a4e-ad4a-94c9f3458cba", "server_message_id": "9fb7a659-f5e3-4605-92e9-b0cee394245b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:33.525000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:33.522612+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，您连续发了几次\"1\"，是：\n\n- **测试** 我是否在？\n- **想表达\"是/确认\"**？\n- **有其他意思**？\n\n请直接告诉我您的需求，我随时准备帮助您 😊", "client_message_id": "5a23eb26-a96b-497e-b599-f33c491d6b53", "server_message_id": "52924d55-0d77-4d9a-ad29-d4440756fc4b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:36.921000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:36.931005+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "6809", "client_message_id": "7e8d4fc8-7db1-4bf4-be58-7f84abd8b10e", "server_message_id": "fa08b047-0ef4-4e35-873e-e5f7e6f4f7ab", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:45.681000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:45.758508+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"6809\" 可能代表：\n\n- **价格**（6809元）💰\n- **编号/代码**（订单号、房间号、产品型号等）\n- **年份**（6809年？不太可能😄）\n- **密码/验证码**？\n- **其他含义**？\n\n请告诉我具体背景，我可以更好地帮助您！😊", "client_message_id": "c338e04d-b03c-4995-b322-9df3491b2d32", "server_message_id": "ec58af0f-d9ec-4430-bafb-e9ce13a23c7e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:49.683000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:30:49.706617+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "998998", "client_message_id": "50a46cb7-395c-4dde-9feb-442a906e7219", "server_message_id": "9d1cf472-60c1-480f-98f9-52e54435b357", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:31:08.526000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:31:08.514085+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"998998\" 可能代表：\n\n- **价格**（998998元，或促销价998元？）💰\n- **编号/订单号**（6位数字组合）\n- **验证码/密码**\n- **网络用语**（\"救救吧救救吧\"？😄）\n- **其他含义**？\n\n请告诉我具体背景或您的需求，我很乐意帮助您！😊", "client_message_id": "9241cf16-2805-462c-8421-347e37c82984", "server_message_id": "9920290e-24fb-4baa-a665-6f98914358dd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:31:12.917000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:31:12.892716+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "共和国v出g个", "client_message_id": "a12955d4-8db8-4a91-9e48-9e46428ad824", "server_message_id": "58f71866-fcaa-4ab5-9435-72b87ef17945", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:08.737000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:08.744047+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"共和国v出g个\" 看起来是打字时的误触或随机输入。\n\n您是想输入：\n- **\"共和国\"**（与政治/历史相关）？\n- **\"共和国出来一个\"**？\n- **其他内容**？\n\n请重新描述一下，我会尽力帮助您！😊", "client_message_id": "71455897-5952-48e1-bdab-bb5471786317", "server_message_id": "a609e531-53b5-4385-87c0-889467293818", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:12.561000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:12.553833+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "四大石窟", "client_message_id": "fa1e5018-6bb7-47bf-af0c-5dbb74bd75bd", "server_message_id": "e43435c7-4433-4198-884d-612ef61d5ae3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:26.976000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:26.957776+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "中国四大石窟指的是：\n\n1. **莫高窟**（甘肃敦煌）  \n   - 以精美的壁画和雕塑闻名，是世界文化遗产，被誉为\"东方艺术明珠\"\n\n2. **云冈石窟**（山西大同）  \n   - 石刻造像气势宏伟，早期雕刻风格带有明显的西域色彩\n\n3. **龙门石窟**（河南洛阳）  \n   - 保留了大量唐代石窟造像，卢舍那大佛最为著名\n\n4. **麦积山石窟**（甘肃天水）  \n   - 以精美的泥塑艺术著称，山势险峻，风景独特\n\n四大石窟汇集了从公元4世纪到14世纪近千年的佛教艺术精华，代表了中国古代石刻艺术的最高成就。其中莫高窟、云冈、龙门都是世界文化遗产。\n\n您想去哪个石窟旅游，还是对哪个石窟的艺术感兴趣呢？ 😊", "client_message_id": "47d2e078-650d-43c4-880e-96673e54e6d1", "server_message_id": "6cb20592-5da3-4bc3-9a46-7e678e532d4b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:36.177000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:36.155780+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户问四大石窟，我需要先回答中国四大石窟是哪些，然后简单介绍一下每个石窟的位置和特点，这样用户就清楚了。不需要调用工具，因为这是常识性问题，直接回答就行。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 1613, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么什么", "client_message_id": "fac53675-83df-4a12-9787-76e530903343", "server_message_id": "c2423dbb-47fc-4bf1-a901-844e2d009917", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:12.483000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:12.478949+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"什么什么\" 是表示疑问或没听清的意思 😄\n\n请问您：\n- **想了解四大石窟的更多信息？**\n- **有其他问题需要我帮忙？**\n- **还是刚才的回答有没理解的地方？**\n\n请直接告诉我您的需求，我会尽力为您解答！🙋‍♂️", "client_message_id": "b2c57993-e2f5-440d-b294-e45c7e80d422", "server_message_id": "e9e6d87b-fde1-4e2b-b776-4fa8afa29a21", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:15.954000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:15.946821+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "好好过", "client_message_id": "36a4dffa-47c1-4aa6-9e8e-9716fe914fd1", "server_message_id": "47353440-360d-4563-b7bb-6f2fe35512f4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:20.585000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:20.571947+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"好好过\" 是一句很温暖的祝福 🌸\n\n常见含义：\n- **好好过日子** — 认真生活，珍惜当下\n- **好好过节** — 节日快乐\n- **好好过（生日/新年等）** — 庆祝愉快\n\n---\n\n您是：\n- **在祝福我？** 😊 谢谢！也祝您生活愉快！\n- **想聊生活/健康话题？**\n- **有具体事情想咨询？**\n\n请告诉我，我很乐意继续交流！", "client_message_id": "9acea1f5-94a0-4fa3-b01e-2d5c84c3fcf2", "server_message_id": "742b0d31-d575-43ab-9afc-1e467b484021", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:25.517000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:25.499617+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈", "client_message_id": "293def0e-2f34-4690-b731-8446f1fd5d30", "server_message_id": "842817e1-6d21-40a9-8877-3e0445f8995e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:31.307000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:31.293193+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈，开心就好！😄\n\n有什么好事想分享吗？还是单纯心情不错？\n\n随时找我聊天或问问题都行！🎉", "client_message_id": "d4616c2c-38b5-4eac-852c-c9c802652cd4", "server_message_id": "b241e8ed-151c-4115-8e0d-327960e263e1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:33.712000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:46:33.689629+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这里是什么", "client_message_id": "33c86ecd-1327-4e5d-bb32-8303de74cfd1", "server_message_id": "5f5b066a-5cc3-4432-bae6-fc6086523800", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:47:15.061000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:47:15.080616+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "5BAED8D3-6D71-4D50-865C-39506590E0AA", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/16D66316-4F41-4E42-8CA7-4C94C47B57D9/IMG_1788.jpeg", "text": "228.co\n产品参数\n商标：亚狮龙/RSL\n品名：羽毛球\nA9-D\n型号：RSL A9D\nsUT.BCOC\nR•S•L\nYadminton\n400mm\n球头：复合软木\nPhutlecat\n注：实际以包装信息为准\n毛片：羽毛\n注：实际以包装信息为准\n数量：12只球\n尺寸：67x67x400mm\n67mm\n67mm\n注：手工测量可能存在一定误差，请以实物为准", "type": "image", "fileId": 252, "fileMd5": "09359811645a88d4287c24b0cbc6f231", "fullCacheKey": "16d66316-4f41-4e42-8ca